<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysaia Sungei Way 1996 net up 41 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysaia Sungei Way 1996 net up 41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    105.23	 vs	  75.06</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	    60.45	 vs	  46.45</p>
<p>    Turnover		    1,430.01	 vs	 851.64</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		179.81	 vs	 125.27</p>
<p>    Minorities (less)	    16.02	 vs	   7.32</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  (less)     2.42	 vs	   2.54</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	     8.0	  vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Sungei Way Holdings Bhd is a construction company involved in infrastructure projects.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
